 "text": "Hi, how are you holding up? That' a common issue. Do you start with the eyes where they should be, or do they end up higher later? Halfway is a great starting point, but if you still feel like they' too high, lower them bit. The nose is the hardest part. Start with the bridge in middle and draw the sides around it, with a bit of slope so it doesn't look flat. Enjoy it. Even a few minutes can make difference. And don't worry if they look a bit cartoony, everyone starts there.",
